# .disclose-allow — exemptions for THIS repository's own fixtures, read by the shared disclose
# workflow from the pull request's BASE (so a pull request cannot widen the exemptions that judge
# it). One per line: <rule-glob> <location-glob> <reason>. A location glob covers a tree path and
# the same path inside the built tarball. Generated by the publisher from its own allow lists;
# only lines for the gate's generic rules are published here.
rfc6598-100  roles/service_headscale/*  Headscale upstream default tailnet prefix, the shared-address range
gitleaks:generic-api-key  roles/service_bind9_dns/molecule/default/records_vars.yml  synthetic TSIG key for the molecule scenario
gitleaks:generic-api-key  roles/service_wireguard_peer/molecule/default/converge.yml  synthetic WireGuard key for the molecule scenario
mac  roles/kea_reservations/molecule/default/*  synthetic reservation MAC in the kea molecule fixtures
